    "title": "LendAPI’s Timothy Li on Accelerating Lending Innovation with No-Code Technology",
    "summary": "For banks, credit unions, and fintechs, launching a new lending product has traditionally required significant investments in technology, engineering resources, and time. Connecting credit bureaus, fraud detection tools, decisioning engines, and customer-facing applications often involves complex integrations that can take months or even years to complete. As competition intensifies and customer expectations evolve, these lengthy Read more...\nThe post LendAPI’s Timothy Li on Accelerating Lending Innovation with No-Code Technology appeared first on Finovate.",
